Grammar

    0 $accept: Program $end

    1 Program: Decls

    2 Decls: Decls Decl
    3      | ε

    4 Decl: FuncDecl
    5     | VarDecl
    6     | TypeDecl
    7     | TypedefDecl

    8 TypedefDecl: TYPEDEF VarType IDENTIFIER SEMICOLON
    9            | TYPEDEF VarType LPARENTHESES ASTERISK IDENTIFIER RPARENTHESES LPARENTHESES ParamList RPARENTHESES SEMICOLON
   10            | TYPEDEF STRUCT IDENTIFIER LBRACE FieldDecls RBRACE IDENTIFIER SEMICOLON
   11            | TYPEDEF UNION IDENTIFIER LBRACE FieldDecls RBRACE IDENTIFIER SEMICOLON

   12 FuncDecl: STATIC VarType IDENTIFIER LPARENTHESES ParamList RPARENTHESES SEMICOLON
   13         | STATIC VarType IDENTIFIER LPARENTHESES ParamList RPARENTHESES FuncBody
   14         | VarType IDENTIFIER LPARENTHESES ParamList RPARENTHESES SEMICOLON
   15         | VarType IDENTIFIER LPARENTHESES ParamList RPARENTHESES FuncBody

   16 FuncBody: LBRACE Stmts RBRACE

   17 VarDecl: STATIC VarType VarList SEMICOLON
   18        | VarType VarList SEMICOLON
   19        | VarType LPARENTHESES ASTERISK IDENTIFIER RPARENTHESES LPARENTHESES ParamList RPARENTHESES SEMICOLON

   20 TypeDecl: _VarType SEMICOLON

   21 VarType: _VarType
   22        | CONST _VarType

   23 _VarType: BuiltinType
   24         | STRUCT IDENTIFIER LBRACE FieldDecls RBRACE
   25         | STRUCT IDENTIFIER
   26         | UNION IDENTIFIER LBRACE FieldDecls RBRACE
   27         | UNION IDENTIFIER
   28         | ENUM IDENTIFIER LBRACE EnumList RBRACE
   29         | ENUM IDENTIFIER
   30         | _VarType ASTERISK
   31         | IDENTIFIER

   32 VarList: VarList COMMA VarInit
   33        | VarInit
   34        | ε

   35 VarInit: IDENTIFIER ArrayBoundList
   36        | IDENTIFIER ArrayBoundList ASSIGN Expr
   37        | IDENTIFIER ArrayBoundList ASSIGN LBRACE InitList RBRACE
   38        | IDENTIFIER ArrayBoundList ASSIGN LBRACE RBRACE

   39 InitList: InitList COMMA InitItem
   40         | InitItem

   41 InitItem: Expr
   42         | LBRACE InitList RBRACE

   43 ArrayBoundList: ArrayBoundList ArrayBound
   44               | ArrayBound
   45               | ε

   46 ArrayBound: LBRACKET INTEGER RBRACKET
   47           | LBRACKET RBRACKET

   48 ParamList: ParamList COMMA Param
   49          | ParamList COMMA ELLIPSES
   50          | Param
   51          | ELLIPSES
   52          | ε

   53 Param: VarType IDENTIFIER
   54      | VarType
   55      | VarType LPARENTHESES ASTERISK IDENTIFIER RPARENTHESES LPARENTHESES ParamList RPARENTHESES

   56 BuiltinType: CHAR
   57            | SHORT
   58            | INT
   59            | LONG
   60            | UNSIGNED
   61            | UNSIGNED CHAR
   62            | UNSIGNED SHORT
   63            | UNSIGNED INT
   64            | UNSIGNED LONG
   65            | FLOAT
   66            | DOUBLE
   67            | BOOL
   68            | VOID

   69 FieldDecls: FieldDecls FieldDecl
   70           | ε

   71 FieldDecl: VarType MemberList SEMICOLON
   72          | SEMICOLON

   73 MemberList: MemberList COMMA IDENTIFIER
   74           | IDENTIFIER
   75           | ε

   76 EnumList: EnumList COMMA Enum
   77         | Enum
   78         | ε

   79 Enum: IDENTIFIER
   80     | IDENTIFIER ASSIGN INTEGER
   81     | IDENTIFIER ASSIGN SUB INTEGER

   82 Stmts: Stmts Stmt
   83      | ε

   84 Stmt: Expr SEMICOLON
   85     | IfStmt
   86     | SwitchStmt
   87     | ForStmt
   88     | DoStmt
   89     | WhileStmt
   90     | ContinueStmt
   91     | BreakStmt
   92     | ReturnStmt
   93     | Block
   94     | TypeDecl
   95     | TypedefDecl
   96     | VarDecl
   97     | SEMICOLON

   98 IfStmt: IF LPARENTHESES Expr RPARENTHESES Stmt ELSE Stmt
   99       | IF LPARENTHESES Expr RPARENTHESES Stmt

  100 SwitchStmt: SWITCH LPARENTHESES Expr RPARENTHESES LBRACE CaseStmtList RBRACE

  101 CaseStmtList: CaseStmtList CaseStmt
  102             | ε

  103 CaseStmt: CASE Expr COLON Stmts
  104         | DEFAULT COLON Stmts

  105 ForStmt: FOR LPARENTHESES Expr SEMICOLON Expr SEMICOLON Expr RPARENTHESES Stmt
  106        | FOR LPARENTHESES SEMICOLON Expr SEMICOLON Expr RPARENTHESES Stmt
  107        | FOR LPARENTHESES VarDecl Expr SEMICOLON Expr RPARENTHESES Stmt

  108 DoStmt: DO Stmt WHILE LPARENTHESES Expr RPARENTHESES SEMICOLON

  109 WhileStmt: WHILE LPARENTHESES Expr RPARENTHESES Stmt

  110 ContinueStmt: CONTINUE SEMICOLON

  111 BreakStmt: BREAK SEMICOLON

  112 ReturnStmt: RETURN SEMICOLON
  113           | RETURN Expr SEMICOLON

  114 Block: LBRACE Stmts RBRACE

  115 Expr: IDENTIFIER
  116     | Constant
  117     | LPARENTHESES Expr RPARENTHESES
  118     | Expr COMMA Expr
  119     | IDENTIFIER LPARENTHESES ExprList RPARENTHESES
  120     | Expr DOT IDENTIFIER
  121     | Expr ARROW IDENTIFIER
  122     | Expr LBRACKET Expr RBRACKET
  123     | LPARENTHESES VarType RPARENTHESES Expr
  124     | LPARENTHESES IDENTIFIER RPARENTHESES
  125     | LPARENTHESES IDENTIFIER RPARENTHESES Expr
  126     | SIZEOF LPARENTHESES VarType RPARENTHESES
  127     | SIZEOF LPARENTHESES Expr RPARENTHESES
  128     | SIZEOF LPARENTHESES IDENTIFIER RPARENTHESES
  129     | ADD Expr
  130     | SUB Expr
  131     | ASTERISK Expr
  132     | AMPERSAND Expr
